    "chunk_text": "\u00dey gemyndgadan gere \u00fe\u00e6re foresprecenan sunnan asprungennisse & hr\u00e6\u00f0e sona \u00fe\u00e6s Swelce eac Erconberht Contwara cyning \u00fey ylcan mon\u00f0e ond d\u00e6ge for\u00f0geleorde, & his riices \u00dea blon micelre tiide se biscopdom, \u00f0a w\u00e6s sended to Rome from Ecgberhte & from Osweo W\u00e6s se mon in ciriclecum \u00feeodscipum of Ongolcynne wel gel\u00e6red. Swylce hy eac \u00fea cyningas begen \u00e6tg\u00e6dre sendon \u00fe\u00e6m apostolican papan micle gife on \u00d0a he \u00f0a to Rome cwom, \u00fea w\u00e6s in \u00fea tid Uitalius papa \u00fe\u00e6s apostolican se\u00f0les aldorbiscop. \u00c6fter \u00feon \u00fee he \u00feone intingan his si\u00f0f\u00e6tes \u00fe\u00e6m apostolican papan gecy\u00f0ed h\u00e6fde, \u00fea \u00e6fter \u00d0a h\u00e6fde se apostolica papa ge\u00feeaht be \u00feissum \u00feingum & georne sohte, hwelcne \u00e6rcebiscop he \u00d0a w\u00e6s in Niridano \u00fe\u00e6m mynstre, \u00fe\u00e6t is unfeor \u00fe\u00e6re byrig Neapoli in Campanie \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e, W\u00e6s se mon in halgum gewreotum & in mynsterlecum \u00feeodscipum & in ciriclecum wel gel\u00e6red, \u00dea het se papa \u00feone mon to him gela\u00f0ian, & heht \u00fe\u00e6t he biscophade onfenge & to Breotone ferde. \u00dea ondswarede he him & cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re swa micles hades unwyr\u00f0e; & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he meahte T\u00e6hte \u00fea \u00feam biscope in \u00fe\u00e6m neahnunnmynstre sumne gedefne munuc, \u00fe\u00e6s noma w\u00e6s Andreas. Ac \u00f0a wi\u00f0stod his lich",
